$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=muinvdvds  LOC_AFTER=?

* The truncated Moebius sum over the divisors of a squarefree number that are multiples of L detects L = M.

s1::muinvlem1 |- ( ( ( M e. NN /\ ( mmu ` M ) =/= 0 /\ L e. NN ) /\ L || M ) -> sum_ d e. { x e. NN | x || M } if ( L || d , ( mmu ` d ) , 0 ) = if ( L = M , ( mmu ` L ) , 0 ) )
